python-orocos-kdl (1.5.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging of the pybind11 based Python 3 bindings, replacing the
    python-orocos-kdl binary package that the orocos-kdl source package used
    to build from the removed SIP bindings.
  * Require Python >= 3.10 and pybind11 >= 3.0.

